; GhostArc — widest, low-alpha cyan-magenta trail. Same arc geometry
; as the others (so the silhouette matches), bumped to width 46 so it
; sits visibly BEHIND/AROUND the other layers. Starts at alpha 0 — the
; script fades it IN over GHOST_LAG (0.06s) so it reads as motion-blur
; trailing the cut, not a second cut.
